    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Centre of Excellence for Trauma and Emergencies (CETE) at Aga Khan University (AKU), in collaboration with the Provincial Disaster Management Authority (PDMA), convened a stakeholder meeting under its 'Heat Emergency Awareness and Treatment' project. Funded by Elrha, the project aims to address the escalating threat of extreme heat events in Pakistan through public awareness, exposure treatment strategies and the development of a comprehensive Heat Plan to mitigate the impact of climate change.",
